<article class="why-invitation" aria-labelledby="why-title">
  <header class="why-welcome">
    <%= image_tag "pull-up-a-chair.webp", class: "why-art", width: 1536, height: 1024, fetchpriority: "high", alt: "Painted illustration of coffee mugs around a shared table, with a chair pulled out toward you." %>
    <div class="why-welcome-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">WHY THE LEGION?</p>
      <h1 id="why-title">Pull up<br>a chair.</h1>
      <p class="why-opening">Some conversations start a little easier when you’ve both served. Where they go from there is the good part.</p>
    </div>
  </header>

  <section class="why-reasons" aria-label="What brings us together">
    <section class="why-reason why-camaraderie" aria-labelledby="why-camaraderie-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">CAMARADERIE</p>
      <h2 id="why-camaraderie-title">Share a<br>laugh.</h2>
      <p>A shared laugh. A familiar face. Military service gives us a place to start; the interests and stories we bring today keep the conversation going.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="why-reason why-community" aria-labelledby="why-community-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">OUR COMMUNITY</p>
      <h2 id="why-community-title">Lend a<br>hand.</h2>
      <p>Help a local student take their next step. Honor those who served. From Badger Boys State and our scholarship to community traditions, there’s good we can do together.</p>
    </section>
    <section class="why-reason why-veterans" aria-labelledby="why-veterans-title">
      <p class="eyebrow">FELLOW VETERANS</p>
      <h2 id="why-veterans-title">Have each<br>other’s backs.</h2>
      <p>A Buddy Check call to see how someone’s doing. A hand finding the next step with veterans benefits. Our Service Officer helps veterans find support, whether or not they’re members.</p>
    </section>
  </section>

  <section class="why-next" aria-labelledby="why-hello-title">
    <div class="why-hello-copy">
      <h2 id="why-hello-title">Start with hello.</h2>
      <p>You don’t have to decide about joining before you meet us. Come to a public event or visit a meeting and see how it feels.</p>
    </div>
    <div class="why-hello-actions">
      <%= link_to events_path, class: "main-action" do %>Find an upcoming event <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span><% end %>
      <%= link_to "What’s a first visit like? →", visit_path, class: "why-story-link" %>
    </div>
    <p class="why-membership">Take part when it fits your life. There’s no attendance or volunteer requirement. <%= link_to "Membership questions?", membership_path %></p>
  </section>
</article>
